{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55066","headline":"兵要望江南 《周易》占候第二十六（三十七首） 二十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 《周易》占候第二十六（三十七首） 二十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"财（辛本、川本作「贼」）爻动，便是我军粮。\n出国寻粮我军旺（辛本、川本作「财旺发」），无财难（辛本、川本作「虽」）旺恐饥荒，仔细好推详（辛本、川本作「半敌遇空亡」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}